{"page":606,"width":1665,"height":2511,"text_angle":0,"lines":[{"text":"670","words":[{"text":"670","x":165,"y":145,"width":57,"height":30}]},{"text":"Chapter 15 피일 시스템 내부구조","words":[{"text":"Chapter","x":291,"y":149,"width":116,"height":28},{"text":"15","x":419,"y":151,"width":35,"height":22},{"text":"피일","x":482,"y":151,"width":40,"height":25},{"text":"시스템","x":531,"y":152,"width":61,"height":24},{"text":"내부구조","x":602,"y":152,"width":81,"height":24}]},{"text":"의 서버 시스템들 사이보니는 임의의 한 씽의 기계 사이에서 허용된다. 시스템의 독립성","words":[{"text":"의","x":293,"y":273,"width":27,"height":35},{"text":"서버","x":336,"y":273,"width":56,"height":36},{"text":"시스템들","x":408,"y":273,"width":118,"height":36},{"text":"사이보니는","x":537,"y":274,"width":145,"height":36},{"text":"임의의","x":695,"y":273,"width":82,"height":35},{"text":"한","x":790,"y":273,"width":31,"height":34},{"text":"씽의","x":832,"y":273,"width":57,"height":35},{"text":"기계","x":905,"y":274,"width":57,"height":36},{"text":"사이에서","x":976,"y":274,"width":122,"height":36},{"text":"허용된다.","x":1116,"y":274,"width":136,"height":36},{"text":"시스템의","x":1270,"y":273,"width":128,"height":36},{"text":"독립성","x":1415,"y":273,"width":92,"height":35}]},{"text":"을 위해서, 원격 파일 시스템의 공그퐈는 다른 시스템에는 영*을 미치지 않고 단지 클라","words":[{"text":"을","x":291,"y":331,"width":32,"height":35},{"text":"위해서,","x":337,"y":331,"width":97,"height":37},{"text":"원격","x":449,"y":332,"width":55,"height":35},{"text":"파일","x":520,"y":332,"width":56,"height":35},{"text":"시스템의","x":592,"y":331,"width":111,"height":36},{"text":"공그퐈는","x":718,"y":331,"width":89,"height":35},{"text":"다른","x":819,"y":330,"width":60,"height":36},{"text":"시스템에는","x":894,"y":331,"width":153,"height":36},{"text":"영*을","x":1062,"y":332,"width":94,"height":35},{"text":"미치지","x":1172,"y":331,"width":94,"height":35},{"text":"않고","x":1286,"y":331,"width":66,"height":35},{"text":"단지","x":1368,"y":330,"width":61,"height":35},{"text":"클라","x":1448,"y":331,"width":62,"height":35}]},{"text":"이언트에게만 영향을 준다.","words":[{"text":"이언트에게만","x":292,"y":389,"width":182,"height":36},{"text":"영향을","x":485,"y":390,"width":86,"height":35},{"text":"준다.","x":581,"y":389,"width":63,"height":35}]},{"text":"원격 디렉터리가 특정 시스템(M1)으로부터 투명히께 접근할 수 있도록 하기 위해","words":[{"text":"원격","x":349,"y":448,"width":56,"height":34},{"text":"디렉터리가","x":424,"y":448,"width":146,"height":34},{"text":"특정","x":582,"y":446,"width":55,"height":36},{"text":"시스템(M1)으로부터","x":655,"y":446,"width":273,"height":39},{"text":"투명히께","x":947,"y":447,"width":121,"height":36},{"text":"접근할","x":1088,"y":448,"width":96,"height":34},{"text":"수","x":1199,"y":447,"width":33,"height":35},{"text":"있도록","x":1251,"y":447,"width":97,"height":35},{"text":"하기","x":1365,"y":446,"width":61,"height":34},{"text":"위해","x":1447,"y":446,"width":59,"height":36}]},{"text":"서, MI의 클라이언트는 먼저 마운트 명령을 수행한다. 이 명령은 원격 디렉터리가 로컬","words":[{"text":"서,","x":292,"y":505,"width":36,"height":36},{"text":"MI의","x":341,"y":505,"width":78,"height":35},{"text":"클라이언트는","x":433,"y":505,"width":176,"height":35},{"text":"먼저","x":621,"y":504,"width":53,"height":36},{"text":"마운트","x":689,"y":504,"width":87,"height":36},{"text":"명령을","x":789,"y":505,"width":88,"height":36},{"text":"수행한다.","x":888,"y":505,"width":129,"height":36},{"text":"이","x":1032,"y":505,"width":27,"height":35},{"text":"명령은","x":1077,"y":505,"width":96,"height":35},{"text":"원격","x":1187,"y":504,"width":61,"height":35},{"text":"디렉터리가","x":1267,"y":504,"width":166,"height":35},{"text":"로컬","x":1445,"y":506,"width":61,"height":34}]},{"text":"파일 시스템의 디렉터리성에 마운트되게 한다. 마운트 명령이 완료되면, 마운트된 디렉","words":[{"text":"파일","x":289,"y":563,"width":60,"height":35},{"text":"시스템의","x":365,"y":563,"width":115,"height":35},{"text":"디렉터리성에","x":497,"y":563,"width":170,"height":35},{"text":"마운트되게","x":682,"y":563,"width":144,"height":35},{"text":"한다.","x":841,"y":563,"width":66,"height":35},{"text":"마운트","x":924,"y":563,"width":92,"height":36},{"text":"명령이","x":1031,"y":563,"width":90,"height":35},{"text":"완료되면,","x":1139,"y":562,"widt